      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i woke up today and the left side of my face is like, totally drooping. i can't even close my eye all the way and it feels really heavy. it doesn't feel like a stroke or anything cuz i feel fine otherwise, no numbness or anything, so i'm thinking it's just like bell's palsy or some nerve thing? is that right??",
